  <para style="h">Jakobe</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lukwalo gwakabva kuna JAKOBE</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jakobe</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jak</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lukwalo gwakabva kuna</para>
  <para style="mt1">JAKOBE</para>
  <para style="imt">Tjinginiso</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Lukwalo gwakabva kuna Jakobe</char> gwakakwagwa nenlume unoyi Jakobe. Kungayetika kuti iwhoyu Jakobe waka ali iye nun'una waYesu, waka alintungamili mugubungano lebagalimoyo lekutanga kakale ali umwe welubahhe gweJerusalema (Mihingo 15.13). Mpositoli Phawuli wakawunti “mhanda” yegubungano lebagalimoyo mulukwalo gweBaGalathiya (BaGalathiya 2.9). Bazibi banogalamoyo kuti lukwalo gwaJakobe gwakakwagwa hule kwemakole angaba makumi mahanu Khirisitu azwagwa. Saku Jakobe waka eli ntungamili wegubungano lebagalimoyo kuJerusalema, angaba akagukwala eliko.</para>
  <para style="ip">Jakobe waka ekwalila “njudzi dzili gumi nembili dzakapalalila kudzimwe hango” (Jakobe 1.1). Zwidiyo zwimulukwalo gwaJakobe zwakalizanila MaKhirisitu ose koga hingisiwa kwematama anoti “njudzi dzili gumi nembili” kolakidza kuti pamwe Jakobe waka ekwalila MaKhirisitu eludzi gwetjiJuta. Ngobe lukwalo igogu gwaka gwakafanila bagwa nebanhu banjinji, gwakafunda ndebo njinji. Jakobe unoleba nekwedlidzana kwebugalimoyo nezwiyeto. Bugalimoyo gwelebeswa goboneka muzwiyeto (Jakobe 2.17). Unotjemela banhu kuti basikudze bafumi kupinda bahayi (Jakobe 2.1-4), kakale unotibudza kuti tilingisise zwatinoleba (Jakobe 3.1-12).</para>
  <para style="iot">Nlongoloso Yezwimukati</para>
  <para style="io1">Jakobe unolezwa babali (Jakobe 1.1)</para>
  <para style="io1">Unotebela nekuludzila MaKhirisitu kuti asimidzile hapa eli mubulemo (Jakobe 1.2-27)</para>
  <para style="io1">Unokotjileba kuti bugalimoyo gwakafanila bonekwa ngezwiyeto (Jakobe 2.1-26)</para>
  <para style="io1">Hule kwayikoku unokusa patjena kuti matama ana masimba kungapani (Jakobe 3.1-12)</para>
  <para style="io1">Jakobe unotjenesa kuti butjenjebvu gweNdzimu gwakasiyana tjini nebutjenjebvu gwehango ino (Jakobe 3.13-4.10)</para>
  <para style="io1">Jakobe unotjemela banhu kuti basizwikudze (Jakobe 4.11-5.6)</para>
  <para style="io1">Jakobe unofidza lukwalo gugwe nepa milayo yakasiyana siyana (Jakobe 5.7-20)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JAS 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 1:1" />Kubva kuna Jakobe, n'hingi weNdzimu newaHe Yesu Khirisitu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JAS 1:1">Ndobuyisa dzose njudzi dzili gumi nembili dzakaandama muhango yose.<verse eid="JAS 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bugalimoyo neButjenjebvu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 1:2" />Makamu angu, mukutole sehanha hapa muhangana nelikwa kwakasiyana siyana, <verse eid="JAS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 1:3" />nekuti moziba kuti likwa kwebugalimoyo gwenyu kozwala simidzila. <verse eid="JAS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 1:4" />Simidzila ngakuhinge ngekuhhele, kuyetila kuti mukule kakale mupelele, musitayile tjimwe. <verse eid="JAS 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 1:5" />Hapa umwe wenyu etayila butjenjebvu, ngaakumbile Ndzimu, unowhowumpa. Ndzimu unopa banhu bose ngekuhalabvuka kakale esingabone nhu nlandu. <verse eid="JAS 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 1:6" />Koga ngaakumbile ngekugalamoyo, esingabvubvume mumoyo, ngobe unobvubvuma unonga bundo levula yegungwa linolawugwa nemhepo. <verse eid="JAS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 1:7" />Iwhoyo nhu aazofanila lingilila kuti unowhowana kene tjimwe kubva kuna He. <verse eid="JAS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 1:8" />Nhu wakajalo una mikumbulo mibili kakale aatozwipila muna kose kwaanothama.<verse eid="JAS 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Buhayi neFumwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 1:9" />Nghalimoyo upasi ngaahanhisiwe nemilidziwa kukwe, <verse eid="JAS 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 1:10" />newakafuma wakafanila hanha hapa edelusigwa pasi, ngobe unowhopalala seluba lebuhwa. <verse eid="JAS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 1:11" />Ngobe hhuba lobhuda lipisa, likapisa buhwa; maluba ago akawa, nenaka kwago kukapela. Ndizo mfumi bo unowhopalala atjipakati kweyeta mihingo iye.<verse eid="JAS 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Likiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 1:12" />Wakakombolegwa nhu unosimidzila hapa ali mukulikiwa, ngobe hapa atjikukunda unowhowamutjila tjiyala tjebutjilo Ndzimu tjaakagadzabgwe ibabo banowundha. <verse eid="JAS 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 1:13" />Kusibe newunoti hapa elikiwa akati, “Ndolikiwa neNdzimu.” Ngobe Ndzimu aangalikiwe nebubi kakale iye tjekukwe haatolika nhu; <verse eid="JAS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 1:14" />koga umwe newumwe nhu unolikiwa hapa edan'wa kakale ekwebgwa neyemula kukwe kubi. <verse eid="JAS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 1:15" />Njemulo mbi dzikabvumigwa dzozwala jinyo; jinyo hapa lakula lozwala lufu.<verse eid="JAS 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 1:16" />Musitjebegwe makamu angu anodikan'wa. <verse eid="JAS 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 1:17" />Tjimwe netjimwe tjipo tjibuya netjipo tjakapelela tjobva pehhugwi, tjibva kuna Tate bezwivoneko basingahanduke sentuzi unohanduka handuka. <verse eid="JAS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 1:18" />Ibo ngekuda kwabo bakatizwala ngedama lelebeswa, kudze tibe bekutanga hha kubali tili mitjelo yekutanga yezwabakabumba.<verse eid="JAS 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wha neYeta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 1:19" />Zibani whoku makamu angu anodikala. umwe newumwe nhu ngaalibilidze wha, anonoke lebeleka, anonoke mon'wa, <verse eid="JAS 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 1:20" />ngobe mon'wa kwenhu akutoyeta lulama kunohakwa neNdzimu. <verse eid="JAS 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 1:21" />Ndizo ke lahani kose sazwibhata nebubi gose gunowanda, muwamutjile ngekutebama, dama lakadzwagwa mumuli, ilo linotubula tjidza meya dzenyu.<verse eid="JAS 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 1:22" />Musibe banhu banowha dama koga, muzwitjebela; koga ibani banhu banoyeta tjalinoleba. <verse eid="JAS 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 1:23" />Ngobe hapa nhu ewha dama koga esingayete tjalinoleba, unonga nhu unozwilinga buso gugwe patjiboni; <verse eid="JAS 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 1:24" />ngobe unozwibona koga hapa ebva ipapo tjinyolotjo unokangan'wa kuti unolingika tjini. <verse eid="JAS 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 1:25" />Koga iwhoyo unoholesesa munlayo wakapelela, nlayo unopa lusununguko, ewuntobela, asinhu unongowha ebva ekangan'wa koga eyeta tjaawha, unowhokombolegwa muna tjaanothama.<verse eid="JAS 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 1:26" />Hapa umwe nhu ekumbula kuti una kunamata, koga eti hapa elebeleka esingahale matama unozwitjebela mumoyo, unonamatila suli. <verse eid="JAS 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JAS 1:27" />Lunamato gwakayengemala gusina hambgwa mbeli kweNdzimu Tate bedu ndiwhogu. kumba siyan'wa nenjhilikadzi mumagwadzo adzo, nezwitjengeta kuti usilongwe hambgwa nehango.<verse eid="JAS 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JAS 2" />
  <para style="s">Tjemegwa Nekweluhalawulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 2:1" />Makamu angu, sebagalimoyo baHe wedu Yesu Khirisitu, He wegudzo, musibe neluhalawulo. <verse eid="JAS 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 2:2" />Ngobe hapa kungangina nlume wakambala zwiyambalo zwentengo upehhugwi nerin'i yezeezi, mun'umba yenamata Ndzimu, kubva kungina umwe nlume wakapalukigwa, <verse eid="JAS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 2:3" />muba muwamutjila zwakanaka iwhoyo wakambala zwiyambalo zwentengo upehhugwi, “Yetji tjigalo, tomukumbila mugale pano,” kun'hayi muti, “Ima hapaya,” kene muti, “Iti para pasi pamakumbo edu,” <verse eid="JAS 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 2:4" />amuzoba neluhalawulo, mukaba batongi banamikumbulo mibi?<verse eid="JAS 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 2:5" />Whililani makamu angu anodikala. Ndzimu haazohala bahayi muno muhango kuti babe bafumi mukugalamoyo kakale babe nghalinhaka dzebumambo gwaakagadzabgwe ibabo banowundha? <verse eid="JAS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 2:6" />Koga imwi malengudza n'hayi. Banomutshambidzila akuta bafumi, akuta ibo banomukakatila kumbahhe dzetonga milandu? <verse eid="JAS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 2:7" />Kakale akuta ibo banotuka zina linolemekedzewa lamunodan'wa nalo?<verse eid="JAS 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 2:8" />Hapa mulondolodza nlayo webumambo, sekwakunolebgwa nelukwalo, “Nowhoda mbakidzani uwo sekwawunozwida iwe tjekuko,” moyeta zwakanaka. <verse eid="JAS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 2:9" />Koga hapa muna luhalawulo, moyeta jinyo, kakale nlayo unomuwana nlandu sebatjinyi. <verse eid="JAS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 2:10" />Ngobe kene yani unolondolodza milayo yose koga akatjuluka un'ompela watjiba nejinyo letjuluka milayo yose. <verse eid="JAS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 2:11" />Ngobe iwhoyo wakati, “Usiyete bupombgwe,” kakale wakati, “Usibulaye.” Hapa usingayete bupombgwe koga ukobulaya, watjivuna nlayo. <verse eid="JAS 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 2:12" />Ndizo ke mulebeleke kakale muyete sebanhu banowhotongewa ngenlayo unopa lusununguko. <verse eid="JAS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 2:13" />Ngobe tonga akutowhoba nemawhilangoni kuna usakalayidza mawhilangoni; koga ke mawhilangoni anokunda tonga.<verse eid="JAS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bugalimoyo neMihingo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 2:14" />Kobhatshani ke, makamu angu, hapa nhu eti una bugalimoyo koga asina mihingo? Galamoyo kukwe kungawuntjidza? <verse eid="JAS 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 2:15" />Hapa limwe gamu lakapalukigwa kakale lisina zodliwa hhuba nehhuba, <verse eid="JAS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 2:16" />umwe pakati kwenyu ekoti kulili, “Uyende zwakanaka, umbale udziyigwe kakale udle ugute,” asawumpa zwinohakiwa nembili, kobhatshani? <verse eid="JAS 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 2:17" />Ndizo galamoyo tjekwako, hapa kusina mihingo, kwakafa.<verse eid="JAS 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 2:18" />Koga umwe unowhoti, “Iwe unakugalamoyo imi ndina mihingo.” Undilakidze galamoyo kuko kuhhe kwemihingo, imi ngemihingo yangu ndowhokulakidza galamoyo kwangu. <verse eid="JAS 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 2:19" />Nogalamoyo kuti Ndzimu un'ompela? Kwakanaka! Meyambi bo dzogalamoyo kujalo, kakale dzotetema ngentha yehla. <verse eid="JAS 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 2:20" />Iwe tjilengwe, nohaka lakidziwa kuti galamoyo kusina mihingo akuta tjimwe? <verse eid="JAS 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 2:21" />Batategulu bedu Abhurahhamu abazolulamisiwa ngentha yemihingo, pabakatola nkololo wabo Isaka bakawunsa patjibeso kudze bawumpile? <verse eid="JAS 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 2:22" />Nobona ke kuti galamoyo kwaka kwakahangana nemihingo, kakale galamoyo kwakapeleledzewa ngemihingo, <verse eid="JAS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 2:23" />nelukwalo gwakahhadzisika, gunoti, “Abhurahhamu wakagalamoyo kuNdzimu, kakale galamoyo kukwe kukabagwa selulama,” akadan'wa eyi nkwinya weNdzimu. <verse eid="JAS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 2:24" />Mobona ke kuti nhu unolulamisiwa ngemihingo kusi ngegalamoyo koga.<verse eid="JAS 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 2:25" />Nayiyeyo zila zwayo Rahabhu, fukula, haazolulamisiwa ngemihingo paakawamutjila batumwa akabayendisa neyimwe zila?<verse eid="JAS 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 2:26" />Sembili wakafa hapa kusina meya, galamoyo bo hapa kusina mihingo kwakafa.<verse eid="JAS 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JAS 3" />
  <para style="s">Lulimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 3:1" />Makamu angu, musibe badiyi nebunji gwenyu, ngobe moziba kuti iswi banodiya towhotongewa zwakasima kupinda bamwe. <verse eid="JAS 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 3:2" />Ngobe toseni totjinya kanjinji, hapa eliyapo usingaleye muzwilebo zwizwe unoba elinhu wakatambunuka, unotubula dziba mbili uwe wose. <verse eid="JAS 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 3:3" />Hapa tilonga matomu pamilomo yembizi kuyetila kuti dzitiwhilile, tolawula mibili yadzo yose. <verse eid="JAS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 3:4" />Lingani kose nezwikepe bo; nekutobe zwili zwikulukulu zwisundiwa nemhepo dzinamasimba, zolawugwa nemigoti mitukununu kuti zwiyende kunohakiwa neyendisi wazo. <verse eid="JAS 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 3:5" />Nelulimi bo gwakajalo, gundungululo nhikinini koga gozwikudza nekwemihingo mikulukulu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JAS 3:5">Lingani, hhitshwaha lopisiwa nesasi yemoto! <verse eid="JAS 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 3:6" />Lulimi bo gonga moto. Lulimi indungululo yembili ihhele bubi, gotjinya mbili wose, gopisa butjilo gwenhu gose nemoto, igo gubesedzegwa negehena. <verse eid="JAS 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 3:7" />Dzose njudzi dzemhuka nenyunyi dzose, nezwibanda zwinosoba nemhuka dzinogala mugungwa, dzingadzikamisiwa kakale dzakadzikamisiwa nenhu, <verse eid="JAS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 3:8" />koga akuna nhu ungadzikamisa lulimi. Agutolawulika guhhele bubi, guhhele buhungu gunobulaya. <verse eid="JAS 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 3:9" />Tolumbidza He Tate bedu nayigo lulimi, tikabuya tikalonga bhiso banhu bakabumbiwa ngetjiso tjeNdzimu nayigo kakale. <verse eid="JAS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 3:10" />Munlomo iwo zwawo kobhuda matama elumbidza nelonga bhiso. Makamu angu, akuzofanila yetika kujalo. <verse eid="JAS 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 3:11" />Nsenya iwo zwawo ungabvilila vula inozipa nevula inobaba? <verse eid="JAS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 3:12" />Makamu angu, nkuyu ungazwala matoba, kene iwo n'hhambi ungazwala makuyu? Akuna nsenya wevula inobaba ungabvilila vula inozipa.<verse eid="JAS 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Butjenjebvu gunobva kuna Upehhugwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 3:13" />Ndiyani wakatjenjela kakale unowhisisa pakati kwenyu? Ngaalayidze ngetjila kukwe kubuya nange mihingo iye inabunhu gunobva mubutjenjebvu. <verse eid="JAS 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 3:14" />Koga hapa muna fupa nenjemulo mbi mumimoyo yenyu, musitongozwikudza muti makatjenjela munyepela lebeswa. <verse eid="JAS 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 3:15" />Butjenjebvu gwakajalo agutonga igogu gunobva pehhugwi, koga ndegwapasi pano muhango, aguta gwemeya, ndegwasatane. <verse eid="JAS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 3:16" />Ngobe panafupa nepupa, kuna sadzikama nezwiyeto zose zwibi. <verse eid="JAS 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 3:17" />Koga butjenjebvu gunobva pehhugwi tjekutanga gubuyanana, gukotjiba nekunyalala, netebama, newhilila, guhhele mawhilangoni nezwiyeto zwakanaka, agutohalawula kakale agutozwitisa. <verse eid="JAS 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 3:18" />Ndulamo igowo lembewu inodzwagwa nekunyalala nayibabo banohhisa kunyalala.<verse eid="JAS 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JAS 4" />
  <para style="s">Ba Nkhwinya neHango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 4:1" />Ini tjinomusa kakabadzana pakati kwenyu, kakale ini tjinota mukagwa? Akutanjemulo dzenyu dzinogwisana mukati kwenyu? <verse eid="JAS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 4:2" />Moyemula koga mukasibe nako; ndizo mubulaya. Motjiba koga mukasikuwane; ndizo mukakabadzana kakale mugwa. Amuna ngobe amutokumbila. <verse eid="JAS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 4:3" />Mokumbila koga mukasiwamutjile, ngobe mokumbila nezila isi iyo, mokumbilila kuti hapa mawamutjidziwa mukuhingise mukuzwihanhisa. <verse eid="JAS 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 4:4" />Imwi banhu basingagalikebgwe! Amutoziba kuti bukhwinya nehango whubatjita tjeNdzimu? Ndizo ke unoyemula kuti abe nkhwinya wehango unozwithama tjita tjeNdzimu. <verse eid="JAS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 4:5" />Kene mokumbula kuti lukwalo gunoti, “Una njemulo dzinahungu nekwemeya yaakata kuti igale mutili,” agutoleba lebeswa? <verse eid="JAS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 4:6" />Koga ngoni dzatinowhigwa neNdzimu inji; ndizo lukwalo guti, “Ndzimu unonyanyayidzana nebanhu banozwikudza, koga unangoni kuna banozwitebamisa.”<verse eid="JAS 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 4:7" />Ndizo, muzwininipise kuNdzimu. Mugwisane naSatane, unowhomutihha. <verse eid="JAS 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 4:8" />Sedzelani kuNdzimu, unowhosedzela kumuli. Ngulani maboko, imwi batjinyi, mutjenese mimoyo yenyu, imwi banhu bana mikumbulo mibili. <verse eid="JAS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 4:9" />Ibani nebuyendasi, mulile mukuwe. Seka kwenyu ngakuhanduke kube lila, nehanha kwenyu kube magwadzo. <verse eid="JAS 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 4:10" />Muzwitebamise mbeli kwaHe, iye unowhomumilidza.<verse eid="JAS 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Usibone Umwe Nhu Nlandu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 4:11" />Musilebane zwakayipa, makamu. Iwhoyo unoleba zwakayipa nekwegamu lile kene bona gamu lile nlandu, unoleba zwakayipa nekwenlayo kakale unobona nlayo nlandu. Koga hapa wobona nlayo nlandu, awutjinlondolodzi wawo koga watjiba ntongi wawo. <verse eid="JAS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 4:12" />Uyapo un'ompela unopa nlayo kakale ali ntongi, unotubula tjidza nepaladza. Koga iwe uyani kuti ungatonga mbakidzani uwo?<verse eid="JAS 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musizwilobe fuba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 4:13" />Tjiwhililani ke imwi munoti, “Nasi kene mangwana towhoyenda kuwumwe nzi tikanolaluka ko gole, tihaba tiwana mari njinji”; <verse eid="JAS 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 4:14" />imwi musingazibe nekwelemangwana. Butjilo gwenyu guni kene? Ngobe monga fulele inobayapo kwelubaka nyana ibva ipela. <verse eid="JAS 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 4:15" />Makafanila kuti muti, “Hapa He bebvuma, towhotjila tikathama whoku nawhokuya.” <verse eid="JAS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 4:16" />Sangwenu, mozwiloba fuba nezwamunohaka thama. Kose ikoku zwiloba fuba kwakayipa.<verse eid="JAS 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 4:17" />Kene yani unoziba kuti ini tjakatambunuka tjaakafanila yeta ekokon'wa tjithama, wathama jinyo.<verse eid="JAS 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JAS 5" />
  <para style="s">Tjemegwa Kwebafumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 5:1" />Tjiwhililani ke, imwi banhu bakafuma, lilani mukuwe ngentha yebulemo gunowhomuwila. <verse eid="JAS 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 5:2" />Fumwa dzenyu dzatjibola nezwiyambalo zwenyu zwatjimunyiwa nentjenje. <verse eid="JAS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 5:3" />Zeezi lenyu nesiliva kwatjidliwa nebulala, bulala igogu gowhobe busupi gwebubi gwenyu kakale gowhopaladza mibili yenyu semoto. Mabutitika bufumi muyetila mahhuba ebupelo. <verse eid="JAS 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 5:4" />Lingani ke! Salipa kwenyu bahingi bakamuhakulila minda dzenyu, mubatshambidzila, banolila. Nelila kwebakamuvunila zwidlo kwatjiswika muzebe dzaHe weMasimba Ose. <verse eid="JAS 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 5:5" />Matjila zwakanaka muno muhango muzwihanhisa; makodza mimoyo yenyu muyilulamisila hhuba lebulawa. <verse eid="JAS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 5:6" />Makawana nlandu nhu wakalulama kakale mukawumbulaya; waka esinganyanyayidzane namwi.<verse eid="JAS 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Moyonlefu neNtembezelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 5:7" />Mube nemoyonlefu, makamu angu, He adze ahhe. Nlimi unomilila zwilimwa zwibuya zwemumavu ngemoyonlefu, kudzina zwiwana vula yekutanga neyebupelo. <verse eid="JAS 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 5:8" />Namwi bo, ibani nemoyonlefu, musinyale moyo, ngobe hha kwaHe kwatjisedzela.<verse eid="JAS 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 5:9" />Musisolane makamu, kuyetila kuti musiwanikwe nlandu; lingani, Ntongi umile pankoba. <verse eid="JAS 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 5:10" />Hapa kulebgwa nekwedziyila neba nemoyonlefu koba kubviwani, makamu angu, lingani balebesambeli bakaleba nekwezina laHe. <verse eid="JAS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 5:11" />Toti bakakombolegwa ibabo bakasimidzila. Makawha nekwesimidzila kwaJobe, nekuti He bakawuyetila ini kubupelo. He bahhele mawhilangoni nengoni.<verse eid="JAS 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 5:12" />Koga ke pehhugwi kwayiko kose, makamu angu, musitune, kene nekudzimu kene nehango kene iko tuna kene neni zwako. ‘Ee’ wenyu ngaabe ‘ee’ na ‘aa’ wenyu abe ‘aa’, kuyetila kuti musiwanikwe nlandu.<verse eid="JAS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 5:13" />Uyapo pakati kwenyu umubulemo? Ngaatembezele. Uyapo pakati kwenyu wakahanha? Ngaambe njimbo dzelumbidza. <verse eid="JAS 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 5:14" />Uyapo pakati kwenyu unogwala? Ngaakumbile bawhola begubungano, bawuntembezelele, bawuhhodze mafuta muzina laHe; <verse eid="JAS 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 5:15" />ntembezelo wewunogalamoyo unowhowuntjidza unogwala, He banowhowumpodza; nehapa akatjinya, unowhoyetigwa mazwibhatigwa. <verse eid="JAS 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 5:16" />Ndizo ke lebululani matjinyo enyu umwe kuwumwe, mutembezelelane, kuyetila kuti mupole. Ntembezelo wenhu wakalulama unamasimba kakale unohinga. <verse eid="JAS 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 5:17" />Elija waka eli nhu bo saswi akatembezela ngekuzwipila kuti vula isine, vula ayizotongona muhango kwemakole matatu anamimwedzi ili kutanhatu. <verse eid="JAS 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 5:18" />Akakotjitembezela kakale kudzimu kukahhuka vula ikana, minda dzikaba nezwidlo.<verse eid="JAS 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 5:19" />Makamu angu, hapa umwe nhu pakati kwenyu angabhuda muzila yelebeswa umwe ekowun'handusa, <verse eid="JAS 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 5:20" />zibani whoku. kene yani unohandusa ntjinyi kubva muzila iye yelahika unowhotjidza meya yentjinyi pafa kakale unowhotshibikila matjinyo manjinji.<verse eid="JAS 5:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 5" />
</usx>